      "label": "Accusatory Political Meme Scene",
      "description": "A scene depicting former U.S. President Barack Obama as the central figure, with overlaid text accusing him of intentionally dividing the nation and fostering hatred, implying he built a 'bridge' of division instead of unity. The scene is framed as a political critique using emotionally charged language to vilify Obama's legacy. The visual composition centers on Obama's somber expression against a blurred White House background, with text dominating the upper and lower portions of the image to convey the accusatory message.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
