      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_23c70709",
      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "barack_obama_presidency",
      "label": "Barack Obama's Presidency",
      "description": "The meme references Barack Obama's tenure as the 44th President of the United States (2009–2017), a period marked by significant political polarization, economic challenges, and debates over healthcare, immigration, and social issues. The text accuses him of fostering division, which is a political claim rooted in his actual presidency and the public discourse surrounding it.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
