      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "white_house_seal",
      "label": "White House Seal",
      "description": "The blurred background featuring the White House and its seal signifies the official setting of the image, implying that the photo was taken during a formal White House event or press conference. This context is essential to understand the image as a political statement, as it associates Obama with his official presidential role.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
